{
  "analysis": "The root filesystem is fuse-overlayfs reporting 984G total, 956G used, 0 available. apt refuses to download 108MB because it thinks there's no space. I need to investigate what's consuming space and whether space can be freed. The 28G difference (984-956) is odd given 0 Avail, so I should look more carefully.",
